<section class="product-editorial__hero" aria-labelledby="warehouse-hero-heading">
  <div class="product-editorial__container product-editorial__hero-layout">
    <header class="product-editorial__hero-copy" data-reveal="copy">
      <h1 id="warehouse-hero-heading">
        <span>不只是</span>
        <span class="product-editorial__highlight">存储和发货，</span>
        <span>而是让商品</span>
        <span>稳定地流转。</span>
      </h1>
      <p>从入仓到交付，我们提供标准化、可视化、可持续优化的一站式仓储与履约服务。</p>
      <div class="product-editorial__hero-action">
        <a href="/contact">立即咨询 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <span>让复杂的供应链，变简单。</span>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="product-editorial__hero-video" data-reveal="copy" data-reveal-self>
      <video
        controls
        playsinline
        preload="none"
        width="854"
        height="480"
        aria-label="仓配作业现场视频"
        poster="/videos/warehouse-fulfillment-20260911-poster.jpg"
      >
        <source src="/videos/warehouse-fulfillment-20260911.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
      </video>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .product-editorial__hero-video {
    min-width: 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .product-editorial__hero-video video {
    aspect-ratio: 854 / 480;
    border-radius: 0.3rem;
    display: block;
    height: auto;
    width: 100%;
  }
</style>
